+# rev0850 overlay application / rights-ledger boundary hardening
+
+Created: 2026-06-13T16:47:00Z
+
+## Main risk addressed
+
+The highest completion risk was no longer another small registry surface; it was that the overlay series could not be safely replayed as a continuous chain from the rev0840 handoff. rev0850 recovers the missing rev0840-to-rev0841 seed patch and adds a guarded application harness so the eventual full canonical pass has an executable path instead of manual patch choreography.
+
+A second concrete risk was that the publication rights gate had closed symlink boundaries for referenced local rights files, but not for the rights ledger itself or root rights sentinels. A future rights-ready ledger must not be read through a symlinked `RIGHTS/` directory or paired with a symlinked root `LICENSE`.
+
+## Code and patch changes
+
+- Added `PATCHES/rev0840-to-rev0841-overlay.patch` from the archived rev0840 and rev0841 bundles, excluding self-referential packaging surfaces.
+- Added `scripts/apply_overlay_stack_rev0850.py` for guarded patch-chain validation, temporary-copy dry runs, and optional application to an operator-supplied full canonical tree.
+- Updated `scripts/validate_overlay_bundle_integrity_rev0848.py` so the overlay self-integrity check now requires a seed handoff patch from rev0840 and a continuous one-revision chain through the current revision.
+- Updated `scripts/publication_rights_gate.py` so `RIGHTS/component_license_ledger.json` and root `LICENSE`/`COPYING`/`NOTICE` files must be archive-local regular files without symlinked components.
+
+## Audit and validation additions
+
+- `AUDIT/OVERLAY_STACK_APPLICATION_HARNESS_REV0850.md` / `.json`
+- `AUDIT/PUBLICATION_RIGHTS_GATE_LEDGER_ROOT_RIGHTS_BOUNDARY_REV0850.md` / `.json`
+- `scripts/validate_overlay_stack_application_harness_rev0850.py`
+- `scripts/validate_publication_rights_gate_ledger_root_rights_boundary_rev0850.py`
+- `VALIDATION/rev0850_targeted_validation.txt`
+
+## Deliberately unchanged
+
+- The rev0840 canonical patch streams remain unchanged.
+- No root `LICENSE`, `COPYING`, final `NOTICE`, component license conclusion, or SPDX/RO-Crate rights assertion was invented.
+- The new harness requires an operator-supplied complete canonical target tree for the real full-tree application pass; this overlay bundle is not that full tree.
+
+## Rights status
+
+Still publication-blocked. rev0850 reduces application-chain and rights-boundary risk; it does not make publication permissible.
+
+---
+
